<title>UK: Robert Fleming sets 100 million stg oct 2000 FRN. [CORRECTED 10:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming sets 100 million stg oct 2000 FRN. [CORRECTED 10:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ROBERT FLEMING CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ROBERT FLEMING AND CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> IBCA	 A+	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p>(Corrects to replace Moody's rating with IBCA's.)  </p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
